BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:liv-team-championship-2026-d1@claude-liv-cal
DTSTAMP:20260727T090000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260827
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260828
SUMMARY:⛳ Aramco LIV Golf Michigan Team Championship
LOCATION:The Cardinal at Saint John's\, 44045 Five Mile Rd\, Plymouth\, M
 I 48170\, USA
GEO:42.393536;-83.478617
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS="44045 Five Mile Rd, Plym
 outh, MI 48170, USA";X-APPLE-RADIUS=150;X-TITLE="The Cardinal at Saint J
 ohn's":geo:42.393536,-83.478617
DESCRIPTION:Round 1 - Thursday 27 August 2026\n\nTV\nFOX\, FS1\, FS2\, Fo
 x Business\, LIV Golf app\n\nVenue: The Cardinal at Saint John's\nAddres
 s: 44045 Five Mile Rd\, Plymouth\, MI 48170\, USA\nTournament dates: Thu
  27 Aug - Sun 30 Aug 2026\nPurse: $25M individual + $5M team (approx.)\n
 Event type: LIV Golf - Team Championship\n\nNotes\n*** EXPECTED TO BE CA
 NCELLED - STILL OFFICIALLY ON ***\n\nStatus at 31 July 2026: LIV has DEL
 AYED any announcement and said nothing this week\, so the event technica
 lly remains on the schedule. But Front Office Sports and multiple outlet
 s report\, from sources\, that it will be cancelled. No tournament infra
 structure or fan hospitality has been built at the venue\, contractors s
 ay travel was cancelled with money still owed\, and the championship rin
 gs reportedly remain unpaid for.\n\nWhy the delay: LIV is mid-negotiatio
 n with potential backers after the Saudi PIF said in April it would stop
  funding the league. It reportedly holds multiple written commitments fr
 om blue-chip firms willing to act as anchor investors\, and is weighing 
 options for what it internally calls LIV 2.0. The working deadline for n
 ew funding is around 1 September.\n\nIf it goes\, elements of the team c
 hampionship may be folded into Indianapolis instead. That would leave LI
 V with 12 events this season rather than 14 - Louisiana was already canc
 elled in April.\n\nAs scheduled: $40m purse (down from $50m)\, $11.2m to
  the winning team\, at The Cardinal at Saint John's.\n\nTee times confir
 med the week of the event - livgolf.com/schedule\nBroadcast listings can
  change.
CATEGORIES:LIV Golf,LIV Golf - Team Championship
URL:https://www.livgolf.com/schedule
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
STATUS:TENTATIVE
END:VEVENT
